OL,3,GNEWSAFears over 'deeply impacting'
OL,4,A20-mile works diversion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man says his family faces more than
OL,7,F180 miles (290km) of added travel a
OL,8,Fweek for his children's school run due
OL,9,Fto roadworks set to go on for 12 weeks.
OL,11,FParts of the A225 Dartford Road in
OL,12,FHorton Kirby near Dartford will be
OL,13,Fclosed between January and March for
OL,14,Fgas company SGN to replace a mains
OL,15,Fpipe.
OL,17,FResident Charles Devine says the
OL,18,Fclosure will add over 20 miles (32.1km)
OL,19,Feach way to the school run and worries
OL,20,Fhis wife could be late for work, while
OL,21,Fothers are raising fears they could
OL,22,Ffeel the pinch amid high fuel prices.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
