OL,3,GNEWSAFears over 'deeply impacting'
OL,4,A20-mile works diversion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for SGN said it
OL,7,F"recognises the impact" that works
OL,8,Fmight cause, while Kent County Council
OL,9,Fsaid closures were sometimes "the only
OL,10,Fsafe way" to carry out works.
